    "The course cites real incidents—Air Canada’s chatbot that hallucinated a refund policy and a Chevrolet dealership chatbot that could be misused—where vibe testing alone led to a production launch that caused reputational and financial damage.",
    "Vibe testing is considered a personal, informal sanity check rather than a reliable deployment strategy.",
    "Proper evaluation requires a structured, repeatable methodology that covers a broad range of scenarios, measures performance against defined metrics, and ensures safety and compliance before the application reaches users."
] 

